rotshield: A read-only btrfs scrubber and NonRAID/Unraid parity-aware
rotshield: recovery utility. It scans btrfs on-disk metadata, verifies the
rotshield: checksum of every data sector, and uses the array P/Q parity to
rotshield: recover single-disk corruption that btrfs cannot self-heal.
